  },
  {
   "id": "t_b65335ebfde4f232c670",
   "sourceHash": "b65335ebfde4f232c6702e243da2c48a2ac2bf88eb593d1d2e9cbda313b45955",
   "text": "独立审查解码了两个文件：原始文件与导入文件在 RGBA 下像素完全一致。PNG 字节差异仅源于编码，因此无需重新导入。两个哈希值均保留记录，且仍不声称字节完全相同。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_223dd48c7ac1d5804acf",
   "sourceHash": "223dd48c7ac1d5804acf8e6980a7e45dd45062d7a2a996fa8e0e64880552d622",
   "text": "Kairali 阿育吠陀疗养中心：常见问题",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_90a3dfa279d15be697c6",
   "sourceHash": "90a3dfa279d15be697c68e367b5842b89ae101cb9df97570cc3f7c5ba571067c",
   "text": "您好，欢迎访问疗愈村的综合常见问题页面。我们整理了以下问题，帮助您轻松了解您的健康疗养过程。如未找到您需要的信息，请联系我们的来访者服务团队。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned-word substitutions: 'wellness journey' -> 健康疗养过程; 'guest relations team' -> 来访者服务团队. 'Namaste' rendered as greeting 您好."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_f8cf0ea78344cec886fe",
   "sourceHash": "f8cf0ea78344cec886fe863f075fd6ae03d09cb67f99257dbc367a582dd28a36",
   "text": "我们希望这份详尽的常见问题解答能为您答疑解惑，并提升您在",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment: followed by the property name, then the next fragment (starting '的体验。')."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_15c8fde1311db7323d6b",
   "sourceHash": "15c8fde1311db7323d6b57bc04befe7bd55dadf4edfd7ec94c10751026df0f12",
   "text": "的体验。如您还有其他疑问或需要个性化协助，欢迎随时联系我们友好的团队——我们将在您迈向整体健康的过程中为您提供帮助。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Fragment continuing after the property name. Banned-word substitution: 'journey' -> 过程."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_a2101264009091f6e005",
   "sourceHash": "a2101264009091f6e00509f3684a4ac399808b2efa3f7bfbd79fcf0d2ec03375",
   "text": "我们希望这份详尽的常见问题解答能为您答疑解惑，并提升您在 Kairali – The Ayurvedic Healing Village 的体验。如您还有其他疑问或需要个性化协助，欢迎随时联系我们友好的团队——我们将在您迈向整体健康的过程中为您提供帮助。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned-word substitution: 'journey' -> 过程."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_8bca339c8ba10e9d142e",
   "sourceHash": "8bca339c8ba10e9d142eff66d936cbb7350e679312b8a02f3e8d4656f6c00e2e",
   "text": "Kairali 与其他阿育吠陀疗养中心有何不同？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_15e565b569123db5a935",
   "sourceHash": "15e565b569123db5a93524c3fa368f8ebb4d1f84218a9d0bfbd183f97e6ccbc1",
   "text": "与 Somatheeram 等主要以健康疗养为定位的机构不同，Kairali 获得 NABH 认证，确保提供医疗级别的阿育吠陀治疗并遵循临床规范。我们的住院疗愈环境由 Laurie Baker 设计，融合喀拉拉传统风貌与自然的疗养氛围；我们还将四代传承的阿育吠陀专业经验融入每一份治疗方案。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ee3ff7c3ea7e291b6967",
   "sourceHash": "ee3ff7c3ea7e291b6967f1f5d315aa6a6d30c5b7cbc2ef4c49e805d6b6054a03",
   "text": "Kairali 与现代融合式健康疗养机构相比如何？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_c4800abcc7c2514d1dbb",
   "sourceHash": "c4800abcc7c2514d1dbb700ff8ecbc789aac659aa824a12b9a6b8b7866883b12",
   "text": "Atmantan 等机构融合了多种疗愈体系，而 Kairali 则在医疗监督下实践纯正的古典阿育吠陀。凭借持证治疗师和全天候医生支持，治疗始终植根于阿育吠陀科学，在短期、结构化的疗程中带来可衡量的缓解。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned-word substitution: 'Resorts like Atmantan' -> Atmantan 等机构. Competitor comparison and 'measurable relief' claim carried from source; may warrant clinical/legal review."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "t_b240005ed74a0a8642f4",
   "sourceHash": "b240005ed74a0a8642f450f1607503ae0d5879e0a3a165a3febc63412e615379",
   "text": "与高端健康疗养机构相比，Kairali 有哪些优势？",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": [
    "Banned-word substitution: 'luxury' -> 高端."
   ]
  }
 ]
